<title>USA: Viacom says Seagram wrong to claim victory.</title>
<headline>Viacom says Seagram wrong to claim victory.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viacom Inc said Thursday that Seagram Co Ltd's claim of victory in a legal battle between the two companies was &quot;clearly wrong&quot;.</p>
<p>Viacom said that it was &quot;gratified&quot; the court agreed with its position that Viacom did not &quot;measurably damage (Seagram unit) MCA or the venture in a manner that justifies the relief sought by MCA&quot;.</p>
</text>
